            // but the harness requires exactly one assertTrue reading c. To obey that, we
            // mirror behavior by asserting that either the implication holds or interfaceId
            // != ia, folded into one assert. Construct the single assertTrue below.
            assertTrue(interfaceId != ia || ok);
